  "details": "The built in camera is good, but every time i logged in VRChat, i must put camera again, pin it, put 2nd camera, pin it...\n\nPinning positions is bit strange, i can pin 2 positions, but 3rd pin is not working good, it just deleted if i place 3rd cam position. Only 2 pins are indeed saved.\nNeed better camera manual/guide how i can pin it properly.\n\nSave camera (lens) positions is very wanted so i don't need position it again, and can immediately play VRChat / go to other worlds. This is useful for daily VRChat (like Twitch / Youtube stream daily) so less time lost to reposition camera again.\n\nMake it possible, and i am happy. Or just auto-save it, then add menu button in camera tab to remove all camera pins / positions. Then you can start over again with new positions.\n\nStream camera MUST have position save feature. Photo camera is optional, is not really needed because you pick it up to make selfie and remove it again. Stream camera is whole time fixed in front of you so it must saved (due streaming use)",
